{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-c28aac7a92f3027662ad9a09a57a0dac5e4be48bbb8b45b5","family_id":"KR:000623","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법","kind":"법률","source_version":"276071","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=276071","source_sha256":"bcb73bb30b84092164a84d6f85dcf76e19bd67f4f4178be2e290e41bb600bb3b","body_sha256":"1b4360608c7f0392c2da622ea58883aefcb89c9f9ef893ec58e993b26758e813","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA <Act No. 6295, Dec. 29, 2000>\n(1) (Enforcement date) This Act shall enter into force on July 1, 2001.\n(2) (General applicability) This Act shall apply to any taxable article which is shipped out from a manufacturing place or declared for importation on or after the date this Act takes effect.\n(3) (Special cases concerning traffic tax on light oil) Notwithstanding the amendments to Article 2 (1) 2, with respect to the articles which are shipped out from a manufacturing place, or declared for importation, for the period from July 1, 2001 to June 30, 2003, the tax rates falling under the respectively applied periods on the following Table shall be applied:\n<table><tr><th rowspan=\"2\">Taxable articles</th><th rowspan=\"2\">Unit</th><th colspan=\"3\">Applicable period and tax rate</th></tr><tr><th>July 1, 2001 to December 31, 2001</th><th>January 1, 2002 to June 30, 2002</th><th>July 1, 2002 to June 30, 2003</th></tr><tr><td>Articles falling under Article 2 (1) 2</td><td>Per litre</td><td>185 won</td><td>191 won</td><td>234 won</td></tr></table>\n(4) (Transitional measures) The traffic tax imposed or to be imposed under the previous provisions as at the time this Act enters into force shall be governed by the previous provisions.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\934d98418ed29247e09ab5e52b125244c3ff63c775206806d64ee3c15b36a039.ascii.json","sha256":"934d98418ed29247e09ab5e52b125244c3ff63c775206806d64ee3c15b36a039"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"1dbc6be64f0aa75e4c1816b4e27380accdd6b0dbb2a1e7a4e5701077bbe7173d","unit_key":"preamble-0"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"194218ffdb3cb55271f94475d41cab739a3b3747075854dfaf254f02f616f535","unit_key":"addenda-04667-19931231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"159d2d1f3f5af256bae83662a60a294c711b34bc2696174c40a313b189881bbd","unit_key":"addenda-04809-19941222"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"18c4cc374747f710b680504227e4095c8a1ada1e097c27fb159b64508a3ea90c","unit_key":"addenda-05494-19980108"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"a2a2df208d000e471914b7e68d54faf5d8e459c8322f1458a090efc3d6aae55e","unit_key":"addenda-06032-19991203"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"468ec7549374aa2c53f594d2935dc44fe48379ce1fcf1a969319d0fb45a13d45","unit_key":"addenda-06295-20001229"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"17d5c5bb72970d28a0cc659bc14b2a04383480f7f1b61a7d620addbfe3221de9","unit_key":"addenda-07011-20031230"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"7aec1cdf67e4783ddb5f20004e39e936c0dcd0dab90f3f9a2fcaddffa40abb8c","unit_key":"addenda-07576-20050708"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"a4d51a84b14ce3c44013a192f6bfdca2e1d2a429b23c7df47862f5a52aa64fd2","unit_key":"addenda-08138-20061230"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"ce92b0da116f02fa9a657a5e0b6f935ea806f44fc0e90dd6bbf3ea93759aed65","unit_key":"addenda-08829-20071231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"8fd0f2deb2da342ceae93f3cba4